🛢  Europe unprepared for energy crisis – diesel and gasoline shortages looming.

While some European media finally mention a possible gas crisis this winter, almost nothing is said about diesel, gasoline, or other Middle Eastern supplies. Citizens have not been briefed on the severity of the situation. The silence appears intentional – a strategy to avoid panic. But with oil supply already taking a massive hit, the consequences could be severe, Alastair Crooke says.

